# The repo is LF everywhere (Prettier's endOfLine default, and tests that read
# source files): Windows checkouts get LF too, whatever core.autocrlf says.
* text=auto eol=lf

# A third-party license, kept byte for byte as shipped.
src/assets/ZACKSLY-LICENSE.txt -text

# Fixtures are compared byte for byte (Steam's own formatting, launcher
# configs): never convert their line endings (Windows checkouts did).
tests/fixtures/** -text
